## Interface: 20506
## Category: Commander
## Title: Commander Ladder
## Author: Devin
## Version: 1.4.0
## Notes: The arena ladder, from outside the game. A script on your Mac (Tools/ladder_feed.py) pulls every player's 2v2, 3v3 and 5v5 rating from Blizzard's web API into a data file loaded at login; Commander Muster merges it with what it has seen, so a rating can show for players nobody has inspected. Names you meet that the feed lacks are saved for its next run. For your own realm it also notes each rated player's faction, class, race, sex, talent tree, guild and last login, which Commander Recruit uses to aim its /who sweep.
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\INV_Misc_Note_02
## SavedVariables: CommanderLadderDB, CommanderLadderWanted
## RequiredDeps: Commander_Events

